            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>The drive device for foldable doors of wardrobes (10), walk-in closets or pieces of furniture comprises a sliding guide (18) fixable to a horizontal wall (11, 12) of the box-shaped body of the wardrobe (10) longitudinally to the front side of the wardrobe (10), at least one guide slider (19) slidably movable along said sliding guide (18), at least one drive member (20) rotatably connected to said at least one guide slider (19) and rotatably connectable to a first (17') or a second (17") leaf of the foldable door (17), and biasing means (22) connected to said drive member (20) for driving a closing and/or opening movement of the foldable door (17).</p>
            </abstract>
